  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# 2.20.0 (23 October 2026)\n- #1516 Add ScribanRegistrationCallback to register custom Scriban functions [feature]\n- #1519 Bump MessagePack from 2.5.302 to 2.5.303 [dependencies]\n- #1521 Add near-miss diagnostics and request count/unmatched endpoints to the admin API [feature]\n- #1522 Downgrade JsonPath.Net from 3.0.2 to 2.2.0 to avoid Open Source Maintenance Fee issues [dependencies]\n- #1515 Allow registering custom Scriban functions (ScribanRegistrationCallback), like HandlebarsRegistrationCallback [feature]\n- #1520 json-everything sub-dependency now has Open Source Maintenance Fee [dependencies]\n\nThe full release notes can be found here: https://github.com/wiremock/WireMock.Net/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
